    "text": "8 KALENDAS SEPTEMBRIS PASSIO SANCTI BARTHOLOMEI APOSTOLI Wyrdwriteras\nTo \u00feyssere becom godes apostol bartholomeus: and eode into \u00feam temple to \u00feam deofolgilde\nOn \u00feam deofolgylde wunode swilc deofol \u00fee to mannum \u00feurh \u00f0a anlicnysse spr\u00e6c: and geh\u00e6lde\nHe derode manna gesih\u00feum: and heora lichaman mid mislicum untrumnyssum awyrde. and\n\u00d0a mid \u00feam \u00fee se apostol into \u00feam temple eode \u00fea adumbode se deofol astaro\u00f0 and ne mihte\n\u00d0a lagon \u00fe\u00e6r binnon \u00feam temple fela adligra manna. and d\u00e6ghwomlice. \u00feam deofolgylde offrodon:\nSe deofol \u00fea beri\u00f0 andwyrde. and cw\u00e6\u00f0;\nEower god is swa f\u00e6ste mid isenum racenteagum gewri\u00feen \u00fe\u00e6t he ne gedyrstl\u00e6c\u00f0. \u00fe\u00e6t he fur\u00feon\nHe axodon;\nHw\u00e6t is se bartholomeus? Se deofol andwyrde;\nHe is freond \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6lmihtigan godes. and \u00fey he com to \u00feyssere scire \u00fe\u00e6t he aydlige ealle \u00f0a\nHi cw\u00e6don;\nSege us his nebwlite \u00fe\u00e6t we hine oncnawan magon;\nBeri\u00f0 him andwyrde;\nHe is bl\u00e6cfexede. and cyrps hwit on lichaman. and he h\u00e6f\u00fe steape eagan and medemlice nosu. and\nHund si\u00f0on he big\u00f0 his cneowa on d\u00e6ge. and hund si\u00feon on nihte. biddende his drihten;\nHis stemn is swilce orm\u00e6te byme: and him fara\u00f0 mid godes englas \u00fee ne ge\u00feafia\u00f0. \u00fe\u00e6t him hungor\n\u00c6fre he bi\u00f0 anes modes. and gl\u00e6d \u00feurhwuna\u00f0;\nEalle \u00feing he foresceawa\u00f0 and wat: and ealra \u00f0eoda gereord he can;\nNu iu he wat hw\u00e6t ic be him sprece. for \u00fean \u00f0e godes englas him \u00feeowia\u00f0 and ealle \u00feing cy\u00fea\u00f0;\n\u00d0onne ge hine seca\u00f0 gif he sylf wyle ge hine gemeta\u00f0. gif he nele. so\u00f0lice ne finde ge hine;\nIc bidde eow \u00fe\u00e6t ge hine geornlice biddon. \u00fe\u00e6t he hider ne gewende. \u00fey l\u00e6s \u00f